        Quantifying Semantic Shift in Financial NLP: Robust Metrics for Market Prediction Stability
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Sun%2C+Z">Zhongtian Sun</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Xiao%2C+C">Chenghao Xiao</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Harit%2C+A">Anoushka Harit</a>, 
      
